<title>HUNGARY: Hungary prelim Dec C/A deficit $503 mln.</title>
<headline>Hungary prelim Dec C/A deficit $503 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's current account deficit widened to $503 million in December 1996 from $53 million in November, according to preliminary figures, the National Bank of Hungary said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>The deficit was $256 million in December 1995.  </p>
<p>HUNGARY C/A BALANCE  (in million dollars)</p>
<p>    DEC 96    NOV 96    JAN-DEC 96   JAN-DEC 95</p>
<p>    -$503     -$53	-$1,679	-$2,465</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
